OL,3,GNEWSAMasts on bomb-laden ship removed
OL,4,Ato stop explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last masts of a bomb-laden
OL,7,Fshipwreck in the Thames Estuary have
OL,8,Fbeen removed.
OL,10,FThe three poles have been visible from
OL,11,Fthe Kent and Essex coasts since the SS
OL,12,FRichard Montgomery sank with 1,400
OL,13,Ftonnes of explosives onboard in 1944.
OL,15,FEngineers began a major bid to remove
OL,16,Fthem earlier in September, after fears
OL,17,Fwere raised about them toppling onto
OL,18,Fand detonating the explosives. The last
OL,19,Fmasts were removed on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
