OL,3,GNEWSAMasts on bomb-laden ship removed
OL,4,Ato stop explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was really important they came off
OL,7,Fnow while the masts were still in a
OL,8,Fcondition where they could be safely
OL,9,Fremoved," project lead Nolan Conway
OL,10,Fsaid.
